abstract: "AI Foundations repository defining epistemic integrity and the claim-to-knowledge validation layer for AI-generated answers, autonomous research agents, research acceleration systems, governance outputs, public knowledge claims, and knowledge-bearing or action-bearing authority. Core rule: An answer is not knowledge unless its source, method, validation, uncertainty, and responsibility remain intact."
